&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and experienced Large Enterprise Account Executive to join our dynamic sales team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for identifying and closing new business opportunities with enterprise-level clients, which are companies with 5,000 employees and above. You will focus on identifying &lt;strong&gt;new business&lt;/strong&gt; opportunities, in addition to &lt;strong&gt;land and expand&lt;/strong&gt; by fostering relationships to maximize opportunities within these organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
